        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARPRO19, Clear Crystal Provence Egg Shaped Knob with Carre Tall Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Plate is a stunning example of how romantic a knobset can be. The Egg Shaped Clear Crystal Provence Knob, when paired with the Stepped Carre Escutcheon makes for an end product that is elegant. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from a wide array of complementary finish colors. The Clear Crystal Provence Egg Shaped Knob with Carre Tall Plate will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/provence-crystal-knob-with-carre-plate-entryset-grandeur-carpro19entr\"><b> Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Plate Entryset.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Provence Egg Knob with Carre Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Provence Clear Crystal Knob with Stepped Carre Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.7</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARPRO19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262364\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARPRO19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
