                "title": "Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Plate",
                "description": "The Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Plate is a stunning example of how romantic a knobset can be. The Egg Shaped Clear Crystal Provence Knob, when paired with the Stepped Carre Escutcheon makes for an end product that is elegant. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from a wide array of complementary finish colors. The Clear Crystal Provence Egg Shaped Knob with Carre Tall Plate will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
